Study Notes for Deuteronomy
DEUTERONOMY—NOTE ON 1:1–5 Prologue. Beginning with this prologue,
there are a number of similarities between the structure of Deuteronomy
and ancient treaty documents (see chart).
Ancient Treaty Structures and Deuteronomy
Ancient Treaty Structure Deuteronomy
