and wicked city. They are v finishing the walls and repairing the
foundations. 13[†]Now be it known to the king that if this city is rebuilt and
the walls finished, they will not pay w tribute, custom, or toll, and the royal
revenue will be impaired. 14Now because we eat the salt of the palace and it
