walls [v. 7]), loss of leadership (king and princes), and loss of revelations
of his will (her prophets find no vision).
LAMENTATIONS—NOTE ON 2:11 my bile. Literally, “my liver,” that is,
emotions. daughter of my people. A term of endearment for Jerusalem
