LAMENTATIONS—NOTE ON 3:1–66 I Am the Man Who Has Seen Affliction.
Chapter 3 has one speaker, a man who has endured suffering, experienced
God’s faithfulness (vv. 1–24), and accepted God’s sovereignty and
